@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<section class="app-page-stack">
	<div class="app-page-card">
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between">
			<div class="max-w-2xl">
				<p class="app-pill">Release ready</p>
				<h1 class="app-h1">Articles</h1>
				<p class="app-copy">
					Build a durable foundation for modern .NET application work with responsive UI patterns,
					clear boundaries, and a lighter, cleaner front-end that still feels production-ready.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="app-stat-grid">
				<div class="app-stat-card">
					<p class="app-stat-label">Stack</p>
					<p class="app-stat-value">.NET 10</p>
				</div>
				<div class="app-stat-card">
					<p class="app-stat-label">UI</p>
					<p class="app-stat-value">Tailwind</p>
				</div>
				<div class="app-stat-card sm:col-span-1 col-span-2">
					<p class="app-stat-label">Delivery</p>
					<p class="app-stat-value">Production ready</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.6fr_0.9fr]">
		<section class="app-panel-card">
			<div class="app-section-header">
				<h2 class="app-section-title">Project overview</h2>
				<span class="app-badge">Updated</span>
			</div>

			<div class="app-body-copy">
				<p>
					The repository is intentionally shaped as a foundation for real engineering work: a
					composition root, domain boundaries, UI patterns, and a layered workflow that keeps
					application logic easy to trace.
				</p>
				<ul class="app-list">
					<li><span class="font-semibold text-(--app-text)">AppHost:</span> local orchestration and service discovery.
					</li>
					<li><span class="font-semibold text-(--app-text)">Domain:</span> application-focused contracts and model
						boundaries.</li>
						<li><span class="font-semibold text-(--app-text)">UI:</span> Blazor components with a modern, responsive,
							theme-aware layout.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</section>

				<aside class="app-panel-card">
					<h2 class="app-section-title">Highlights</h2>
					<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						<span
						class="rounded-full border border-sky-200 bg-sky-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-sky-700">Aspire</span>
						<span
						class="rounded-full border border-violet-200 bg-violet-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-violet-700">Blazor</span>
						<span
						class="rounded-full border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-700">Auth0</span>
						<span
						class="rounded-full border border-amber-200 bg-amber-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-amber-700">xUnit</span>
					</div>
				</aside>
			</div>
		</section>
